book stage.four

point begin record
    field x as override long
    field y as override long
end record

segment begin record
    field start  as point
    field finish as point
end record

envelope of type T begin record
    field item as T
end record

coordinate means override long

job-state begin choice
    when Queued   holding number
    when Running  holding number
    when Complete holding number
    when Failed   holding number
end choice

maybe of type T begin choice
    when Present holding T
    when Absent
end choice

describe receives state as job-state returns text begin paragraph
    consider state
        when job-state.Queued   holding ticket  then give "queued"
        when job-state.Running  holding percent then give "running"
        when job-state.Complete holding records then give "complete"
        when job-state.Failed   holding code provided code is at least 500 then give "server failure"
        when job-state.Failed   holding code then give "client failure"
        otherwise give "unknown"
    end consider
end paragraph

main returns number begin paragraph
    value origin is build point with x being 0, y being 0
    value corner is build point with x being 3, y being 4
    say corner.x
    say corner.y

    value span is build segment with start being origin, finish being corner
    say span.finish.y

    value boxed is build envelope of number with item being 42
    say boxed.item

    value here as coordinate is 7
    say here

    say describe with state being (job-state.Queued holding 41)
    say describe with state being (job-state.Failed holding 503)
    say describe with state being (job-state.Failed holding 404)

    value found as maybe of number is maybe.Present holding 42
    consider found
        when maybe.Present holding payload then say payload
        when maybe.Absent then say "no value"
    end consider

    value label as text is consider found
        when maybe.Present holding payload give "present"
        when maybe.Absent give "absent"
        otherwise give "unknown"
    end consider
    say label

    variable values as array of number is [1, 2, 3]
    set values at 1 to 7
    say values at 0
    say values at 1
    say the length of values
    append 9 to values
    say the length of values

    allocate buffer as pointer to number sized 2
    set buffer at 0 to 40
    set buffer at 1 to 2
    say (buffer at 0) plus (buffer at 1)
    release buffer

    give 0
end paragraph
